```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
  participant P as Popup
  participant B as Background
  participant C as Content
  P->>B: CAPTURE_FULLPAGE
  B->>C: SNAP_GET_LAYOUT
  C-->>B: LayoutInfo
  loop steps
    B->>C: SNAP_SCROLL_TO(y)
    Note over B: wait SETTLE_EXTRA_MS
  end
  B->>B: stitchChunks via OffscreenCanvas
  B-->>P: { dataUrl } or { error }
```
